   "text": "12 bands. 1 the vocabulary, if a term below is new \u00b7 2 the spine \u00b7 3 chain to tape \u00b7 4 inside one decision \u00b7 5 replay to quote \u00b7 7 the artifact pipeline \u00b7 8 the front end \u00b7 9 proof and\ngates \u00b7 10 every refusal in one place \u00b7 11 what is not built, and where to work next.",
