   "text": "advance_to(t) yields (frontier, t] and nothing else. The\nfrontier only moves forward; asking it to rewind raises.",
   "originalText": "advance_to(t) yields (frontier, t] and nothing else. The\nfrontier only moves forward; asking it to rewind raises.",
