   "text": "Ingest the window, update the estimators, assemble an Observation, call the policy, return a Decision. It holds no\ncapability to act, cannot read a clock or a socket, and cannot tell which driver is calling it. Opened up in band 4.",
   "originalText": "Ingest the window, update the estimators, assemble an Observation, call the policy, return a Decision. It holds no\ncapability to act, cannot read a clock or a socket, and cannot tell which driver is calling it. Opened up in band 4.",
