   "seed": 1546813569,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1546813569,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1786531955200,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WardenLive.perform calls executor.mint / rebalance / pull. Three implementations exist: SimulatedExecutor (tests),\nRecordingExecutor (what `make warden` actually runs \u2014 it journals instead of signing), and ChainExecutor, which broadcasts.\n**Nothing constructs the third.** agents/warden/__main__.py does not import it, the not-built ledger says so, and a test\nholds that claim to the file. So the live lane below this box is built and unwired.",
   "originalText": "WardenLive.perform calls executor.mint / rebalance / pull. Three implementations exist: SimulatedExecutor (tests),\nRecordingExecutor (what `make warden` actually runs \u2014 it journals instead of signing), and ChainExecutor, which broadcasts.\n**Nothing constructs the third.** agents/warden/__main__.py does not import it, the not-built ledger says so, and a test\nholds that claim to the file. So the live lane below this box is built and unwired.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
