   "text": "decreaseLiquidity, collect, burn, mint \u2014 closing first,\nso a crash in the middle leaves the agent flat and\nsolvent rather than stranded. The signer asserts the\nchain id, refuses unless explicitly taken out of dry\nrun, checks for a revert, and reads the kill file\nimmediately before broadcast.",
   "originalText": "decreaseLiquidity, collect, burn, mint \u2014 closing first,\nso a crash in the middle leaves the agent flat and\nsolvent rather than stranded. The signer asserts the\nchain id, refuses unless explicitly taken out of dry\nrun, checks for a revert, and reads the kill file\nimmediately before broadcast.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
