   "text": "pure: core, estimators, lvr, replay | i/o: chain, indexer | drivers: agents, ops, registry, sessions, tearsheet\ncore/ is the base of the tower and depends on nothing of ours; pure layers may not import i/o or driver layers even transitively.",
