   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Twenty-two public endpoints were probed; three\nserve eth_getLogs at all. The rest answer for\nchain 56 and refuse every log query, so the health\ncheck probes the capability rather than the chain\nid.",
   "originalText": "Twenty-two public endpoints were probed; three\nserve eth_getLogs at all. The rest answer for\nchain 56 and refuse every log query, so the health\ncheck probes the capability rather than the chain\nid.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
