   "text": "5,000-block windows, the ceiling both log-serving\nendpoints declare. A refusal halves the chunk and\nretries; 'exceed maximum block range' is\nclassified as a range error rather than a\ntransient one, so a tighter cap corrects itself.",
   "originalText": "5,000-block windows, the ceiling both log-serving\nendpoints declare. A refusal halves the chunk and\nretries; 'exceed maximum block range' is\nclassified as a range error rather than a\ntransient one, so a tighter cap corrects itself.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
