   "text": "Resumes from the ranges nobody has read, not from\nthe cursor \u2014 a cursor is one high-water mark, so\nonce the tail has run it is the head. Block time\nis measured at runtime; BSC has changed it three\ntimes.",
   "originalText": "Resumes from the ranges nobody has read, not from\nthe cursor \u2014 a cursor is one high-water mark, so\nonce the tail has run it is the head. Block time\nis measured at runtime; BSC has changed it three\ntimes.",
