   "text": "A cursor over the swap table, bounded by a SQL\nparameter rather than by a list in memory \u2014 so\nthere is no in-memory future to leak. Same\nprotocol as MemoryTape.",
   "originalText": "A cursor over the swap table, bounded by a SQL\nparameter rather than by a list in memory \u2014 so\nthere is no in-memory future to leak. Same\nprotocol as MemoryTape.",
