   "updated": 1786531955200,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "None and [] are different claims: [] says we checked and there\nare no holes, None says nobody can now say. The build stamp\ncarries both, so a card stamped 'chain' over a tape with a\nhole in it is visible rather than plausible.",
   "originalText": "None and [] are different claims: [] says we checked and there\nare no holes, None says nobody can now say. The build stamp\ncarries both, so a card stamped 'chain' over a tape with a\nhole in it is visible rather than plausible.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
