   "text": "gamma 0.8 theta 0.5 tau_cool_s 7200 w_min_mult 4 mev_haircut_bps 10.0 z_pull 2.5 m_toxic 3 m_clear 10 window_hours 24.0 max_rebalances_per_day 8 sample_interval_s 5 replay_windows 20\nkappa_r2_floor 0.5 arb_cost_bps 5.0 imbalance_window 50 inrange_floor 0.7 eps_liquidity_share 0.01",
