   "seed": 1568073556,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1568073556,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1786531955200,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Warden core/policy.py :: decide \u2014 Avellaneda-Stoikov mapped onto v3 ranges. Everything to the left is this one.\nGrid agents/grid/policy.py :: decide_grid \u2014 a fixed ladder; no sigma, no kappa, no toxicity.\nSentinel agents/sentinel/policy.py :: sentinel_policy \u2014 threshold de-risk; its whole active behaviour is leaving and coming back.\nDIY core/policy.py :: passive_policy \u2014 mint once at the same width and never move. The baseline every card is measured against.",
   "originalText": "Warden core/policy.py :: decide \u2014 Avellaneda-Stoikov mapped onto v3 ranges. Everything to the left is this one.\nGrid agents/grid/policy.py :: decide_grid \u2014 a fixed ladder; no sigma, no kappa, no toxicity.\nSentinel agents/sentinel/policy.py :: sentinel_policy \u2014 threshold de-risk; its whole active behaviour is leaving and coming back.\nDIY core/policy.py :: passive_policy \u2014 mint once at the same width and never move. The baseline every card is measured against.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
