   "text": "CEX-DEX gap above fee + 5 bps for m_toxic = 3\nconsecutive samples, OR |imbalance z| > 2.5.\nWith no feed, fall back to realized LVR running\nabove realized fees \u2014 which reacts after the\ndamage rather than before it, and the card\nrecords which arm fired.",
   "originalText": "CEX-DEX gap above fee + 5 bps for m_toxic = 3\nconsecutive samples, OR |imbalance z| > 2.5.\nWith no feed, fall back to realized LVR running\nabove realized fees \u2014 which reacts after the\ndamage rather than before it, and the card\nrecords which arm fired.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
