   "text": "r = y - q\u00b7gamma\u00b7sigma\u00b2\u00b7(T-t). Holding too much\ntoken0 (q > 0) pushes the range *down*, which\nmakes the position a keener seller of the\nexcess. gamma = 0.8.",
   "originalText": "r = y - q\u00b7gamma\u00b7sigma\u00b2\u00b7(T-t). Holding too much\ntoken0 (q > 0) pushes the range *down*, which\nmakes the position a keener seller of the\nexcess. gamma = 0.8.",
   "fontSize": 12,
