   "text": "delta* = \u00bd[gamma\u00b7sigma\u00b2(T-t) +\n(2/gamma)\u00b7ln(1+gamma/kappa)]. More volatility,\nwider; richer flow at the mid, tighter. The\none-half is already applied \u2014 halving it again\nis the ported-code bug D-3 exists to prevent.",
   "originalText": "delta* = \u00bd[gamma\u00b7sigma\u00b2(T-t) +\n(2/gamma)\u00b7ln(1+gamma/kappa)]. More volatility,\nwider; richer flow at the mid, tighter. The\none-half is already applied \u2014 halving it again\nis the ported-code bug D-3 exists to prevent.",
   "fontSize": 12,
