   "text": "Round to the spacing grid exactly once \u2014\nrounding to an integer tick first disagrees on\n4.95% of inputs, by a whole spacing each time.\nFloor at w_min = 4 \u00d7 spacing, which on this pool\nis the floor that actually binds (P-17).",
   "originalText": "Round to the spacing grid exactly once \u2014\nrounding to an integer tick first disagrees on\n4.95% of inputs, by a whole spacing each time.\nFloor at w_min = 4 \u00d7 spacing, which on this pool\nis the floor that actually binds (P-17).",
