   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The branch, and the three paths below it are\nmutually exclusive. This is where the first\nversion of this band was wrong: it drew the\ngates as one straight sequence, so an\nout-of-market position appeared to pass through\nR1-R4. It never sees them.",
   "originalText": "The branch, and the three paths below it are\nmutually exclusive. This is where the first\nversion of this band was wrong: it drew the\ngates as one straight sequence, so an\nout-of-market position appeared to pass through\nR1-R4. It never sees them.",
