   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "R1 drift \u2265 theta\u00b7width (theta = 0.5) \u00b7 R2 the expected fee *gain* clears gas +\nslippage + MEV \u00b7 R3 cooled for 2h and under 8 moves today \u00b7 R4 not toxic. All four\nare always evaluated, even once one has failed, so the tearsheet can say which one\nheld the position still.",
   "originalText": "R1 drift \u2265 theta\u00b7width (theta = 0.5) \u00b7 R2 the expected fee *gain* clears gas +\nslippage + MEV \u00b7 R3 cooled for 2h and under 8 moves today \u00b7 R4 not toxic. All four\nare always evaluated, even once one has failed, so the tearsheet can say which one\nheld the position still.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
