   "text": "Walks the tape on a fixed delta_s = 5s grid\nrather than per event, which is what makes\n'm consecutive samples' mean a duration\ninstead of a trade count.",
   "originalText": "Walks the tape on a fixed delta_s = 5s grid\nrather than per event, which is what makes\n'm consecutive samples' mean a duration\ninstead of a trade count.",
