   "text": "replay/driver.py :: CostModel \u2014 notional:\nwhat a move actually swaps",
   "originalText": "replay/driver.py :: CostModel \u2014 notional:\nwhat a move actually swaps",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "mq0450",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 756,
   "y": 5255.25,
   "width": 268.32,
   "height": 165.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "mq0446"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1578755914,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1578755914,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1786531955200,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "gas 3e-05 in token1 (600k gas at the\nprevailing BSC price) \u00b7 slippage 5 bps \u00b7\nMEV haircut 10 bps (A4). Both bps are\ncharged on what a move actually swaps, and\nthat is three different quantities: a\n**recentre** swaps only the imbalance;\n**opening** from one asset swaps half the\ncapital; **returning after a pull** swaps\nonly the gap between what the burn paid out\n\u2014 a v3 position pays out *both* tokens \u2014\nand what the new range wants.",
   "originalText": "gas 3e-05 in token1 (600k gas at the\nprevailing BSC price) \u00b7 slippage 5 bps \u00b7\nMEV haircut 10 bps (A4). Both bps are\ncharged on what a move actually swaps, and\nthat is three different quantities: a\n**recentre** swaps only the imbalance;\n**opening** from one asset swaps half the\ncapital; **returning after a pull** swaps\nonly the gap between what the burn paid out\n\u2014 a v3 position pays out *both* tokens \u2014\nand what the new range wants.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "mq0451",
