   "text": "20 overlapping sub-windows, each half the\nspan, times 3 gamma perturbations at \u00b125% \u2014\n60 independent replays. Overlapping because\ndisjoint windows over 30 days are a day and\na half each, too short for a 24h horizon to\nmean anything.",
   "originalText": "20 overlapping sub-windows, each half the\nspan, times 3 gamma perturbations at \u00b125% \u2014\n60 independent replays. Overlapping because\ndisjoint windows over 30 days are a day and\na half each, too short for a 24h horizon to\nmean anything.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
