   "text": "Fork, not spawn: every policy and every\ntape factory in this repo is a closure and\ncannot be pickled. Only a pair of integers\ncrosses the pipe, so the arithmetic is\nunchanged.",
   "originalText": "Fork, not spawn: every policy and every\ntape factory in this repo is a closure and\ncannot be pickled. Only a pair of integers\ncrosses the pipe, so the arithmetic is\nunchanged.",
