   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "p25 \u00b7 p50 \u00b7 p75 \u00b7 every window return \u00b7 how\nmany finished in profit \u00b7 median in-range\nfraction \u00b7 median recentres \u00b7 the basis\nsentence \u00b7 and, when it refuses, why. Plus\n`distinct_returns`, which is the honest\nqualifier on all of it \u2014 see the refusal\nregister.",
   "originalText": "p25 \u00b7 p50 \u00b7 p75 \u00b7 every window return \u00b7 how\nmany finished in profit \u00b7 median in-range\nfraction \u00b7 median recentres \u00b7 the basis\nsentence \u00b7 and, when it refuses, why. Plus\n`distinct_returns`, which is the honest\nqualifier on all of it \u2014 see the refusal\nregister.",
