   "text": "vUSDT, vUSDC on Venus Core Pool. Every input the rate formula\nneeds is inside the log \u2014 cashPrior, interestAccumulated,\nborrowIndex, totalBorrows \u2014 so a rate is recomputable from the\ntape with no chain state re-read.",
   "originalText": "vUSDT, vUSDC on Venus Core Pool. Every input the rate formula\nneeds is inside the log \u2014 cashPrior, interestAccumulated,\nborrowIndex, totalBorrows \u2014 so a rate is recomputable from the\ntape with no chain state re-read.",
