   "text": "supplyRatePerBlock() needs a blocks-per-year constant that is\n**not readable from chain** \u2014 the interest-rate model reverts on\nevery accessor for it \u2014 and the plausible values span 6.67x.\nborrowIndex is monotone, so differencing it needs no constant at\nall. P-22.",
   "originalText": "supplyRatePerBlock() needs a blocks-per-year constant that is\n**not readable from chain** \u2014 the interest-rate model reverts on\nevery accessor for it \u2014 and the plausible values span 6.67x.\nborrowIndex is monotone, so differencing it needs no constant at\nall. P-22.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
