   "text": "The look-ahead guards are inherited, not re-implemented:\n`ingest` raises on an event newer than the decision. A RateEvent\nsatisfies the same protocol a Swap does, which is why there is\none firewall and not two.",
   "originalText": "The look-ahead guards are inherited, not re-implemented:\n`ingest` raises on an event newer than the decision. A RateEvent\nsatisfies the same protocol a Swap does, which is why there is\none firewall and not two.",
