   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1 bps from PancakeSwap v3 USDT/USDC 0.01%, plus 250,000 gas\nunits priced from the chain. This was two literals \u2014 a gas\nfigure forty times BSC's cost and a fee copied from a WBNB/USDT\npool \u2014 and they decided everything the agent published. P-25.",
   "originalText": "1 bps from PancakeSwap v3 USDT/USDC 0.01%, plus 250,000 gas\nunits priced from the chain. This was two literals \u2014 a gas\nfigure forty times BSC's cost and a fee copied from a WBNB/USDT\npool \u2014 and they decided everything the agent published. P-25.",
