   "updated": 1786531955200,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Taken from the accrual the estimator has seen, not from the\ntape's last row. The emitters passed `rows[-1]` in as a\nconstant, so a window replayed on day one was sized by a market\nmeasured on day seven \u2014 look-ahead, in the project whose claim\nis that look-ahead is impossible.",
   "originalText": "Taken from the accrual the estimator has seen, not from the\ntape's last row. The emitters passed `rows[-1]` in as a\nconstant, so a window replayed on day one was sized by a market\nmeasured on day seven \u2014 look-ahead, in the project whose claim\nis that look-ahead is impossible.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
