   "text": "The wallet this was built by has a real BSC record and no liquidity positions in it, so 'here is what I earned' would be a fabrication. Every card says it\nis a replay, the badge is asserted by a test, and the front end renders it as prominently as the number it qualifies \u2014 A6.",
   "originalText": "The wallet this was built by has a real BSC record and no liquidity positions in it, so 'here is what I earned' would be a fabrication. Every card says it\nis a replay, the badge is asserted by a test, and the front end renders it as prominently as the number it qualifies \u2014 A6.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
