   "text": "Throws on any request that is not root-absolute. The jsdom tests stub fetch and match on the basename, so a wrong prefix was invisible to them \u2014 every\nroute but '/' fetched from a page-relative path and rendered an error state while the suite stayed green.",
   "originalText": "Throws on any request that is not root-absolute. The jsdom tests stub fetch and match on the basename, so a wrong prefix was invisible to them \u2014 every\nroute but '/' fetched from a page-relative path and rendered an error state while the suite stayed green.",
