   "text": "Compiles Exposer.sol \u2014 a thin wrapper over\nupstream v3-core and v3-periphery at the\ncommits pinned in ops/forge_deps.txt \u2014\ndeploys it to a bare anvil, and asks it the\nquestions we ask ourselves.",
