   "text": "Factory resolves the address \u00b7 feeProtocol read not\nassumed \u00b7 decimals read (BSC's USDT is 18, not 6) \u00b7\nspacing matches the tier (100->1, 500->10, 2500->50,\n10000->200) \u00b7 initialised and not pinned at an extreme \u00b7\na mintable range exists at w_min \u00b7 liquidity supports a\nposition without being the pool \u00b7 both tokens have code.",
   "originalText": "Factory resolves the address \u00b7 feeProtocol read not\nassumed \u00b7 decimals read (BSC's USDT is 18, not 6) \u00b7\nspacing matches the tier (100->1, 500->10, 2500->50,\n10000->200) \u00b7 initialised and not pinned at an extreme \u00b7\na mintable range exists at w_min \u00b7 liquidity supports a\nposition without being the pool \u00b7 both tokens have code.",
