   "text": "A checklist in a document gets read carefully once and skimmed\nthereafter. This one executes, exits non-zero, and prints the\nremedy. Anything it cannot verify is UNVERIFIED \u2014 an amber\nlight, never a green one.",
   "originalText": "A checklist in a document gets read carefully once and skimmed\nthereafter. This one executes, exits non-zero, and prints the\nremedy. Anything it cannot verify is UNVERIFIED \u2014 an amber\nlight, never a green one.",
