   "text": "Fewer than 20 usable replays and the spread describes the sample, not the strategy. The note distinguishes 'not enough windows' from 'the windows were\ntoo short'.",
   "originalText": "Fewer than 20 usable replays and the spread describes the sample, not the strategy. The note distinguishes 'not enough windows' from 'the windows were\ntoo short'.",
