   "updated": 1786531955200,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Rates are reported as zero \u2014 no verdict \u2014 until 30 swaps have been seen. LVR is an upper bound and fees accrue in slivers, so a sample of one almost\nalways reads as toxic and produces a pull-wait-remint loop. A12.",
   "originalText": "Rates are reported as zero \u2014 no verdict \u2014 until 30 swaps have been seen. LVR is an upper bound and fees accrue in slivers, so a sample of one almost\nalways reads as toxic and produces a pull-wait-remint loop. A12.",
