   "text": "Dry run is the default rather than a flag. The kill file is checked once a second by the loop and again inside the signer immediately before broadcast \u2014\nredundant on purpose; the second one is the load-bearing one.",
   "originalText": "Dry run is the default rather than a flag. The kill file is checked once a second by the loop and again inside the signer immediately before broadcast \u2014\nredundant on purpose; the second one is the load-bearing one.",
