   "text": "At most 8 re-entries a day. Deliberately asymmetric: it gates coming back, never leaving. An agent forbidden to exit would be held inside the flow the\nrule exists to escape.",
   "originalText": "At most 8 re-entries a day. Deliberately asymmetric: it gates coming back, never leaving. An agent forbidden to exit would be held inside the flow the\nrule exists to escape.",
