   "updated": 1786531955200,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The badge itself is built \u2014 `python -m misquote.vetting` reads nine checks off chain and writes vetting/badges/<pool>.json \u2014 and the fork lab under\nvetting/forge exists and runs. Nothing joins them: a FAIL today is a sentence, not a transaction that reverts.",
   "originalText": "The badge itself is built \u2014 `python -m misquote.vetting` reads nine checks off chain and writes vetting/badges/<pool>.json \u2014 and the fork lab under\nvetting/forge exists and runs. Nothing joins them: a FAIL today is a sentence, not a transaction that reverts.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
