   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1786531955200,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Blocked on a wallet-signed nonce exchanged for a session JWT, which is the same signing path the 24h burn-in needs and which does not exist yet.\nDeliberately not half-built: an auth module that cannot complete the exchange would look present on this page while doing nothing. The public half does\nwork and carries the finding that matters \u2014 `/api/v1/explorer/jobs` needs no credentials and is what let a real order be read back and decoded (P-18).",
   "originalText": "Blocked on a wallet-signed nonce exchanged for a session JWT, which is the same signing path the 24h burn-in needs and which does not exist yet.\nDeliberately not half-built: an auth module that cannot complete the exchange would look present on this page while doing nothing. The public half does\nwork and carries the finding that matters \u2014 `/api/v1/explorer/jobs` needs no credentials and is what let a real order be read back and decoded (P-18).",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
