   "text": "What to do next, in dependency order",
   "originalText": "What to do next, in dependency order",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "mq1002",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1608,
   "y": 9520.0,
   "width": 1141.92,
   "height": 45.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "mq0999"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1636566322,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1636566322,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1786531955200,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1 \u00b7 Extend the backfill to a full 30 days and fit kappa on it, which clears two blocking gates at once (G-4 and the tape gate) and lets the cards stop carrying a provisional constant.\n2 \u00b7 Re-run make artifacts against that tape so the advantage report stops being generated on a synthetic one \u2014 the third blocking gate.\n3 \u00b7 Wire ChainExecutor into agents/warden/__main__.py behind an explicit flag, which is the last thing standing between the journal and a real burn-in.",
   "originalText": "1 \u00b7 Extend the backfill to a full 30 days and fit kappa on it, which clears two blocking gates at once (G-4 and the tape gate) and lets the cards stop carrying a provisional constant.\n2 \u00b7 Re-run make artifacts against that tape so the advantage report stops being generated on a synthetic one \u2014 the third blocking gate.\n3 \u00b7 Wire ChainExecutor into agents/warden/__main__.py behind an explicit flag, which is the last thing standing between the journal and a real burn-in.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "mq1003",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1608,
   "y": 9571.0,
   "width": 363.0,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "mq0999"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1636671051,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1636671051,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1786531955200,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "each one closes a gate that make go-no-go already names",
   "originalText": "each one closes a gate that make go-no-go already names",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
